     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have a problem with printing python output in my stdout-file. As you can see below I get an objective function value, but irace does not print it in the stdout-file. Hence, the stdout-file is created, but remains empty. Any idea how to solve this?</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">The</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output was</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">15568.7671404</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vsc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mounts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leuven</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">310</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vsc31046</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tuning</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runner</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> command </span><span style=\"color:#008\">not</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> found<br><br></span><span style=\"color:#606\">Thu</span><span 