     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi Jeroen,<div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">It seems that in \r\nyour version of bash, functions like error() need to be defined before \r\nbeing used. Move the code &quot;error(){...}&quot; to the top of the file. Also, \r\nput in EXE= just pypy and move the rest to FIXED_PARAMS, otherwise the \r\ncheck for -x EXE cannot work.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">If\r\n you know python better than bash, you may wish to rewrite target-runner\r\n in python directly. There are examples that come with the package.</div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Cheers, <br></div><div dir=\"auto\"><br></div><div dir=\"auto\">Manuel. <br></div></div>"
    ],
    [
     3,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><br><br>On Thursday, 21 December 2017 18:21:36 UTC, jeroen.corstjens  wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>Hello,<div><br></div><div>I have a problem with printing python output in my stdout-file. As you can see below I get an objective function value, but irace does not print it in the stdout-file. Hence, the stdout-file is created, but remains empty. Any idea how to solve this?</div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border-color:rgb(187,187,187);border-style:solid;border-width:1px;word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> irace </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#606\">The</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> output was</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#066\">15568.7671404</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vsc</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hard</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">mounts</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">leuven</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">user</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#066\">310</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vsc31046</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">tuning</span><span style=\"color:#660\">/</span><span style=\"color:#000\">target</span><span style=\"color:#660\">-</span><span style=\"color:#000\">runner</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#066\">35</span><span style=\"color:#660\">:</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> error</spa